* Female Scientists first appeared in {{3v2|Diamond|Pearl|Platinum}} as NPCs.
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Scientist" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for [[Evolution|evolving]] at least three Pokémon.

